===Participate in Trianne's funeral{{subst:void|<!--104021301-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location="Eternal Holy City" Okhema|Though we won the fight against the Flame Reaver, we have lost Trianne forever.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Unused &mdash; Talk294)
----
::'''Aglaea:''' You've returned unscathed and brought tidings of triumph. Truly a moment worthy of celebration.
::'''Tribbie:''' We smell sunlight in the wind of Okhema...
::'''Tribbie:''' This was your favorite spot, wasn't it, Trianne?
::'''Castorice:''' Lady Trianne... Why did it have to end up like this?
::'''Tribbie:''' Take it easy, Cas. Departure is a part of life. It's just that '''ours''' isn't as tumultuous as it is for ordinary folks.
::'''Trinnon:''' When '''we''' started our journey, {{Rubi|Janus|Passage Titan}} had already provided their prophecy. Just like how that Titan divided themself to create the countless passages in the world...
::'''Trinnon:''' It's only natural for '''us''' to follow the same path since '''we''' inherited their destiny.
::'''Phainon:''' If you don't mind, Tribbie...
::'''Phainon:''' Are you still willing to unveil that past for us? The past regarding the "prophecy."
::'''Tribbie:''' What do you seek to learn, Snowy?
::'''Phainon:''' ...
::'''Phainon:''' Mydeimos has left the city to face his own fate.
::'''Phainon:''' That is the fate of every demigod. We will all eventually let go of our past to follow the same path as his.
::'''Phainon:''' So, what I want to know is &mdash; As Amphoreus' first demigod, what compelled you to take the first step on this journey?
::'''Phainon:''' And what has sustained you to make it this far without looking back, despite the fracturing of your body and the numerous departures you have endured?
::'''Tribbie:''' ...Alright.
::'''Aglaea:''' Teacher, are you sure about this?
::'''Tribbie:''' De is already doing what he has to do... What reason do '''we''' have to keep it from them? Let's go, everyone...
::'''Trinnon:''' Let's go to the Abyss of Fate and see how it used to be.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Count me in.
:::'''Tribbie:''' That's great. Thank you.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Mem, time to work!
:::'''Tribbie:''' Then... '''we''' will leave it to you.
::{{tx}}
:----
::{{tx}}

;(Unused &mdash; EnterDistrict_G65)
:{{tx}}
:----
::'''???:''' ...
::'''Oronyx:''' *Titan's murmurs*
::'''Oronyx:''' Tri... bios...
