::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Wait, I can understand the Titan language now?
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Fancy simultaneous interpretation!
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Your voice now sounds so... mature.
::'''Trinnon:''' This is '''our''' memory, so your senses are also aligned with the Tribios' of that moment.
::{{tx}}

