===Enter Tribios' abode{{subst:void|<!--104021330-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location="Sanctum of Prophecy" Janusopolis|update|As Trinnon returned to her homeland, familiar sights stirred forgotten memories within her &mdash; of people, moments, and treasures she thought time had washed away.}}
